# Overview

RULES FOR CURSOR AI:

1. You MUST fully remove all existing CSS, SCSS, styled-components, inline styles, or any legacy styling.
2. You MUST convert ALL styling to Tailwind CSS.
3. You MUST use ONLY the colors, fonts, and sizes defined below. NO EXCEPTIONS.
4. You MUST create or update tailwind.config.js with:
   - Custom colors
   - Custom font families
   - Custom font sizes
5. You MUST create base typography and global styles in @layer base.
6. You MUST import Google Fonts once globally:
   - Manrope (400, 600, 700)
   - Inter (400, 600, 700)
   - Use font-display: swap
7. Headings (h1–h3) MUST use Manrope. Body text MUST use Inter.
8. Font weights:
   - Headings: 600–700
   - Body text: 400–500
   - Never use thin/light for body text.
9. Color palette:
   - bg-light: #faf8f5
   - bg-base: #ffffff
   - text-dark: #1a1a1a
   - text-soft: #3a3a3a
   - accent: #dbb89c
   - border-light: #e4dfda
10. Typography scale:
    Desktop:
      - H1: 56px, line-height 1.1, font-weight 700
      - H2: 40px, line-height 1.2, font-weight 600
      - H3: 32px, line-height 1.25, font-weight 600
      - Body: 20px, line-height 1.6
      - Buttons/CTA: 18px, font-weight 600
    Mobile:
      - H1: 36px
      - H2: 28px
      - Body: 18px (min)
      - Buttons: 16–18px
11. Letter-spacing:
    - Headings: -0.02em
    - Uppercase labels only: +0.05em
12. Buttons:
    - Padding: min 14px vertical
    - Border-radius: 8–12px
    - Dark background default, accent hover
13. Sections:
    - Light background
    - Bottom border using border-light
14. Layout:
    - Max width: 1300px
    - Container width: 90%
    - Section vertical padding: 80px desktop, 48px mobile
15. Responsiveness:
    - All typography must scale correctly
    - Mobile body text >= 18px
16. Utilities:
    - Use Tailwind utility classes for all elements
    - Use @layer components only if necessary
17. Final output:
    - Refactored tailwind.config.js
    - Base global CSS
    - Updated components with Tailwind classes
    - No legacy CSS
18. Validation:
    - Ensure readability, premium look, modern beauty style
    - No horizontal scrolling on mobile
    - All headings and body follow font rules exactly

IF ANY EXISTING STYLES CONFLICT:

- Refactor them completely
- Do not merge legacy CSS with Tailwind

TASK:
Replace all current styles in the project with Tailwind CSS according to the rules above.
